      "text": "In this portion, we give a mathematical model for the transmission of the Zika virus using the Atangna-Baleanue in Caputo sense of fractional order. We make two portions of the Human population: Susceptible people and infected people so that = + . Same as we make two portions of a total number of mosquitoes into two groups: Susceptible mosquitoes Sq and infected mosquitoes , so that = + . To explain the method of the spread of the Zika virus given in [26], we consider the compartmental mathematical model as follows:",
