    {
      "unit_id": 63,
      "text": "Uniqueness and stability of the iterative scheme Theorem 4.1. Let ( 2 , ||. ||) be a Banach space and M be a self-map of 2 satisfying || − || C||X− ||+C||X-Y|| for all x, y ∈ 2 where 0≤ , 0 ≤ < 1.",
